    "created_at": "2018-08-08T15:35:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-08T15:35:54Z",
    "body": "Testcase:\r\n\r\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\r\n    <script defer src=\"data:application/javascript,alert('before: ' + getComputedStyle(document.body).color)\"></script>\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/cgi/test-tools/delayed-file?pause=2&mime=text%2Fcss&text=body+%7B+color%3A+red+%7D\">\r\n    <script defer src=\"data:application/javascript,onload = function() {alert('load: ' + getComputedStyle(document.body).color);}; alert('after: ' + getComputedStyle(document.body).color)\"></script>\r\n\r\nLooks like Edge waits for sheets (because they block the parser in general in Edge?) and no one else does right now... but again, maybe they should.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
