    "updated_at": "2019-06-18T03:45:55Z",
    "body": "Spec:\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#stop-parsing\r\nStep 3.1 waits until \"the parser's Document has no style sheet that is blocking scripts\" before executing the deferred/module scripts.\r\nSo IIUC the spec says `<script defer>` should wait for style sheets, but implementations are failing consistently.\r\n\r\nTest: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/1663585\r\n=> Upstreamed to https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/17372",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
